     fullBackupContent, not dataExtractionRules. Read that file's header for
     the full WHY (plaintext timeline DB + pairing tokens) and the
     🔴 CURRENTLY INERT note (android:allowBackup="false" already disables
     both mechanisms; this file is the documented backstop).
-->
